      "claim": "The industry's focus on future existential risks functions as a rhetorical distraction from the measurable biases in current algorithms.",
      "targets": []
    },
    {
      "claim": "Automated systems currently prioritize speed and cost-reduction over procedural fairness.",
      "targets": []
